# Auto Commit & Push

After completing any code changes in this project:

1. Commit all relevant changes with a concise message focused on why.
2. Push to the remote branch immediately after a successful commit.
3. Do not ask for confirmation before committing or pushing unless the user explicitly says not to.
4. Never commit secrets (`.env`, credentials, API keys).
5. Never force-push to `main` or `master`.

If there are no changes to commit, skip commit and push.
